Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:03.80,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Is this the last train tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.10,0:00:06.40,Default,Kenta,0,0,0,,I think so. We should hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:09.30,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Wait — did you bring the tickets?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:12.00,Default,Kenta,0,0,0,,They're in my coat. Both of them.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.00,0:00:14.00,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Platform 2 — Northbound
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:15.10,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Then let's go before the doors close.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:18.20,Default,Kenta,0,0,0,,We'll meet again at the station,\NI promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.60,0:00:21.00,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,You always say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.40,0:00:24.30,Default,Kenta,0,0,0,,And I always come back, don't I?
Comment: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,TL note: check the line above against the script
